config SERIAL_TEST
    bool "Test serial port"
    default y
    help
      A serial port, serial0, and its far end as a raw device,
      serialtest: what serialtest is written comes in on the
      port, reading it gives what the port sent, and an ioctl
      on it receives a byte with a line error. For the
      userspace tests of serial ports and terminals

config UART16550
    bool "16550 UARTs"
    default y
    help
      Serial ports on a 16550 or a compatible UART, such as
      the COM ports of a PC as the firmware describes them

config UART16550_PCI
    bool "16550 UARTs on PCI serial cards"
    depends on UART16550 && PCI
    default y
    help
      PCI serial controllers of the 16550 interface, and the
      pci-serial cards of QEMU with up to four ports
